# approx's searches (search anneal, search cmaes) on the forms beside the
# polynomial and rational ones: the core of a range reduction and the two
# pieces of a split, each core moved on its own sample from where the
# ulp walk stopped, and the candidate kept only when the table's measure
# agrees it is better (measured, not certified)
#
# exp on [-4, 4]: x = k ln 2 + r, the core a polynomial in r
approx exp(x) in -4..4 degree 5 as f32 norational nosplit list 1 search anneal budget 300
# exp on [0, 1] without a reduction: the two pieces' coefficients
approx exp(x) in 0..1 degree 4 as f32 norational noreduce list 3 search anneal budget 400
